SRR17017205	PRJNA782904	SRP347429	SAMN23407596	SRX13207293	Homo sapiens	ES2_Final_rep1	ES2_Final_rep1	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM5701087: ES2_Final_rep1 Homo sapiens OTHER	OTHER	GENOMIC	other	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	Genomic DNA was extracted using a QIAGEN Blood and Cell Culture DNA Midi Kit (#13343) according to the manufacturer's protocol. 125 μg of genomic DNA from each sample was split into 2.5 μg fractions and sgRNA sequences were amplified using Herculase II enzyme following published protocols and instructions supplied by authors on Addgene #90294 (Hart T et al., G3 (Bethesda) 2017. 7(8): 2719-2727). Reactions were measured for fragment size using the Agilent 2200 Tapestation, and quantified using the KAPA SYBR Fast qPCR Kit (KAPA Biosystems, #7959362001).	34900343	2303422638	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR170/005/SRR17017205/SRR17017205.fastq.gz	42d0e1f422e2c463aac7fd792a1b8c80	885695859
